# Coding Standards

- Follow existing naming and import conventions in the repo
- Use functional components and hooks
- Co-locate styles with components when that pattern exists

- Minimal diffs — change only what the task requires
- No drive-by refactors or unrelated formatting
- Match surrounding error handling and logging patterns
- Prefer extending existing utilities over new abstractions
